// Page VigilanteOrRogueWithoutTalkToken Text :
"P4102950094" "So, you want to jump over to the other side? You think you're up for it?  You're free to come and go as you please and team up with others, but you're going to have to stop sitting on the fence before people really trust you."
// Page VigilanteOrRogueWithTalkToken Text :
"P2233946558" "So, you're either a Vigilante or a Rogue and you want to see what life is like on the other side... Good luck with that. Take the sub behind me to your destiny... Heh, nice knowing you."
// Page WrongAlignment Text :
"P325705260" "Sorry, buddy. You and I shouldn't really be seen talkin'. You don't want to ruin your rep, ya' know. Come back when you've decided to make some 'life choices'. I'd be curious to know how that works out for you."
// Page Fallback Text :
"P1133982530" "Keep walkin', buddy. You don't want to talk to me and I sure as Arachnos don't want to talk to you."
// DisplayName for N_GR_Boatman :
"P3357213445" "Submariner Janus"
